{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元のお友達と遊びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、誕生日がお互い近かったのでプレゼント交換をしました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4820BAKZ54N85ZCGYQGFW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nありがとう〜!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなブランドとかも同じでお買い物がすごく楽しいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントをもらったら、20歳になった感じがしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手がぶれたー。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN483NB952CJ6VWA5QBF67M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n背景がめっちゃピンク!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこを撮ってもかわいいので、いるだけですごく幸せになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が飲んだのは、バナナセサミスムージーです!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN485FT31886ZMC8026ZG6W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nバナナ感が強くておいしかった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜のパフェ最高でした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN486RNNFXEG15AAXF71P9T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n髪飾りありがとう(o^^o)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}